    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/34/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "最高に強化されたヘビーボール。重たくて飛ばないが　油断しているポケモンに当てると高い捕獲性能を発揮。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "최고로 강화된 헤비볼. 무거워서 잘 날아가지 않지만, 방심하고 있는 포켓몬에게 맞히면 높은 포획 성능을 발휘한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "強化到最高階的沉重球。沉重而無法遠投，但若能命中掉以輕心的寶可夢，就能發揮強大的捕獲能力。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cette version ultime de la Masse Ball est trop lourde pour être lancée au loin, mais si elle atteint un Pokémon distrait, le taux de réussite est élevé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die ultimative Version des Schwerballs. Dieser schwere Ball kann nicht weit fliegen. Dafür ist die Erfolgsquote hoch, wenn er ein unaufmerksames Pokémon trifft.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Versión inmejorable de la Peso Ball. Muy pesada para lanzarla a largas distancias, aunque tiene un porcentaje muy alto de éxito si se usa contra un Pokémon distraído.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Versione potenziata al massimo della Peso Ball. È troppo pesante per essere lanciata lontano, ma se colpisce un Pokémon distratto ha un’alta probabilità di cattura.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ultimate iteration of the Heavy Ball. A ball that is too heavy to fly high or far, but it is highly effective if you manage to hit an unsuspecting Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
